  <h1>Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
  <div class="updated">Last updated: 5 September 2026</div>
  
<div class="card">
<p>We want you to love what you order. Here's how cancellations, returns, and refunds work at Jagashilp.</p>
</div>

<h2>Order Cancellation</h2>
<ul>
  <li>You can cancel your order for free as long as it hasn't been dispatched yet — reach out to us via the Help Center with your order number.</li>
  <li>Once an order has been dispatched, it can no longer be cancelled.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Customised / Hand-Painted Products</h2>
<p>Since every customised or personalised product (keychains, canvases, and other made-to-order items) is created specifically for you, these items are <strong>not eligible for return or refund</strong> once made, except in the case of a genuine defect, damage in transit, or a wrong item being delivered.</p>

<h2>Damaged, Defective, or Wrong Item</h2>
<ul>
  <li>If your order arrives damaged, defective, or different from what you ordered, contact us within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> via the Help Center, along with clear photos/video of the product and packaging.</li>
  <li>Once verified, we will offer a <strong>free replacement</strong>. If a replacement isn't possible, we will process a refund instead.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Refund Method & Timeline</h2>
<ul>
  <li>For prepaid (Razorpay) orders, approved refunds are credited back to the original payment method within 5–7 business days.</li>
  <li>For Cash on Delivery (COD) orders, approved refunds are processed via bank transfer/UPI — we will collect your payment details for this once your refund is approved.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>For any order issue, please use the Help Center on our website, or write to us at <a href="mailto:v8xmedia@gmail.com">v8xmedia@gmail.com</a> / call +91 70614 59730.</p>

